 yeah i'm very very when do you  think fans will get like a first look  you know like stuff like that  i genuinely don't know we're we're  literally in the midst of filming it  right now  um so my last question for you um what  actually i don't know how involved you  are with sandman like on a day to day  and how it all works but what exactly  happens  to you  if sandman is a big hit this is a big  hit and both are sort of going next year  what exactly is your life  very complicated it was already very  complicated um  never in my wildest dreams did i imagine  i would work on  either of these shows much less both of  these shows at the same time uh it's  it's it's been a privilege and um and  it's a bit crazy and i'm i'm just glad  that my wife supports both of the shows  um  so basically you're effed next year both  get a season two  i i'll need to clone myself like the  cleons  oh hey listen um because i'm out of time  um i would love to actually talk to you  about specific spoilers after i get to  see the finale and run it down the road  because i didn't i would love to i know  i'm i'm dying to talk about the show  after people see episode 10. yeah i i  because i didn't ask anything  specifically especially about that the  the religious there's so many things i  want to get into but i can't say it you  know what i mean let's let's do it  apple happy to do it
 

